Reseller ostida tekshiring.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Bu API kaliti domen qidiruvi uchun zarur boʻlgan sites.view ruxsatiga ega emas. Uni reeller panelingizdagi kalitga qoʻshing yoki ommaviy qidiruvga qaytish uchun kalitni bu yerda tozalang.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Faqat administratorlarga ko‘rinadi:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'Buni tekshirib bo‘lmadi — qayta urinib ko‘ring','Already registered'=>'Allaqachon roʻyxatdan oʻtgan','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Mavjud — narxini bizdan so\'rang','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'Birinchi yil uchun %1$s %2$s — Mavjud','Register it'=>'Roʻyxatdan oʻtkazish','Manage my hosting'=>'Hosting-ni boshqarish','Please sign in first.'=>'Iltimos, avval tizimga kiring.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Bu hisob hali hosting xizmatiga ulanmagan.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Hosting platformasi kirish havolasini qaytarmadi.','Reseller Toolkit'=>'Reseller asboblar to\'plami','Account'=>'Hisob','Features'=>'Funksiyalar','Styling'=>'Uslublar','Your Zinn Digital® reseller account'=>'Sizning Zinn Digital® reseller hisobingiz','Create a reseller API key in your Zinn® dashboard under Settings → API keys, and paste it here.'=>'Zinn® boshqaruv panelidagi Sozlamalar → API kalitlari bo\'limida sotuvchi API kalitini yarating va uni shu yerga qo\'ying.','Reseller API key'=>'Reseller API kaliti','Held on this site only, and never included in an export or a diagnostics report.'=>'Faqat ushbu saytda saqlanadi va hech qachon eksport yoki diagnostika hisobotiga kiritilmaydi.','Plan to provision'=>'Ta’minlanadigan reja','The plan code new customers are put on. Leave blank to be asked each time.'=>'Yangi mijozlar biriktiriladigan tarif kodi. Har safar so\'ralishi uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','API address'=>