'This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Bu ushbu plaginning barcha sozlamalarini standart holatiga qaytaradi. Davom etasizmi?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash uchun diagnostika','Import a settings file'=>'Sozlamalar faylini import qilish','Import'=>'Import qilish','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Eksport qilingan fayllarda hech qachon parollar, tokenlar yoki API kalitlari bo\'lmaydi — ularni yangi saytda qaytadan kiritishingiz kerak bo\'ladi.','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Ushbu plaginning barcha sozlamalari odatiy holatiga qaytarildi.','Done.'=>'Bajarildi.','That action is not available.'=>'Bu amal mavjud emas.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ushbu faylni oʻqib boʻlmadi. Zinn® plaginidan eksport qilingan sozlamalar faylini tanlang.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Bu fayl sozlamalar eksporti uchun juda katta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Ushbu fayl Zinn® sozlamalari eksporti emas.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Bu fayl boshqa plagindan (%s) eksport qilingan, shuning uchun uni bu yerga import qilish ushbu plagin tushunmaydigan sozlamalarni saqlaydi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d ta sozlama import qilindi. Parollar va API kalitlari eksportga kiritilmaydi, shuning uchun ularni qaytadan kiriting.' . "\0" . '%d ta sozlama import qilindi. Parollar va API kalitlari eksportga kiritilmaydi, shuning uchun ularni qaytadan kiriting.','Connected'=>'Ulangan','Connecting…'=>'Ulanmoqda…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Uzlangan, lekin e\'tibor talab qiladigan narsa bor','Not connected'=>'Ulanmagan','Running on your own account'=>'Oʻz hisobingizda ishlayapti','We could not check this'=>'Buni tekshira olmadik','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Bu plagin nima sababdan ekanini ko‘rsatmadi. Diagnostika hisobotini yuboring va biz buni ko‘rib chiqamiz.','Connection status'=>'Ulanish holati','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Oxirgi marta %s oldin tekshirilgan.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yangi tabda ochiladi)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga yuborish','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Bu aynan yuboriladigan narsa — boshqa hech narsa va hech qanday yashirin narsa yo\'q. Parollaringiz, tokenlaringiz va API kalitlaringiz uning ichida emas.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Yuboriladigan diagnostika hisoboti','Copy to clipboard'=>'Buzlatqichga nusxalash','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Ushbu hisobotni Zinn® qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga yuboring','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Biz siz uchun qo\'llab-quvvatlash so\'rovini ochamiz va elektron pochta orqali javob beramiz. Agar buni yuborishni xohlamasangiz, yuqoridagidan nusxa oling va uni o\'zingiz so\'rovga qo\'ying.','Copied'=>'Nusxa olindi','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ushbu serverdan (%s) Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi. Yuqoridagi hisobotni nusxalab oling va uning o‘rniga chekin oching — sozlamalaringizda hech qanday xato yo‘q.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati xabaringizni qabul qildi va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati hisobotingizni qabul qildi — maʼlumot raqami %s — va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Qisqa vaqt ichida bir nechta hisobot yubordingiz. Bir necha daqiqa kuting va qayta urinib ko\'ring — avvalgilari yetib borgan.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® hozircha hisobotni qabul qila olmadi — bu bizning tomonda, siznikida emas. Ozgina vaqtdan keyin qayta urinib ko\'ring yoki yuqoridagi hisobotni tiketga nusxalang.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Hisobot rad etildi (HTTP %d). Uni yuqoridan nusxalab oling va shu raqamni ko\'rsatgan holda murojaat oching.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qo\'llanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qo\'llanmasini o\'qing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kunlik zaxira nusxalari, bepul migratsiya va birdan ortiq sayt yurituvchi shaxslar uchun mo‘ljallangan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Tayyor saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishni sotib oling va soting, mablag\' esa har ikki tomon rozi bo\'lgunga qadar xavfsiz tarzda saqlanadi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — buni kasb qilgan mutaxassislarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilanserlar bozori: matn yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini ko\'rib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtirib, ularga taklif kiritish imkonini bering.','Style preset'=>'Uslub sozlamasi','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Boshlang‘ich nuqta. Undan pastdagi har qanday narsa buni bekor qiladi.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'O\'z ranglarim va o\'lchamlarimdan foydalanish','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Buni o\'chirib qo\'ying va andoza aynan qanday bo\'lsa shunday ishlatiladi.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® chiqarilish eslatmalarini ko\'ring.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish yaxlitlik tekshiruvidan o\'tmadi va o\'rnatilmadi.']];